  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "q09_solution",
      "condition": "$\\overline{\\text{AC}}=\\overline{\\text{AD}}+\\overline{\\text{DC}}=4\\text{ cm}$, $\\overline{\\text{BC}}=2\\text{ cm}$이므로 직각삼각형 $\\text{ABC}$에서 $$\\overline{\\text{AB}} = \\sqrt{4^2 + 2^2} = \\sqrt{20} = 2\\sqrt{5}\\text{ (cm)}$$ 직각삼각형 $\\text{BCD}$에서 $$\\overline{\\text{BD}} = \\sqrt{2^2 + 2^2} = 2\\sqrt{2}\\text{ (cm)}$$ $\\triangle\\text{ABD}$의 넓이는 밑변 $\\overline{\\text{AD}}=2\\text{ cm}$, 높이 $\\overline{\\text{BC}}=2\\text{ cm}$이므로 $\\frac{1}{2}\\times 2\\times 2 = 2\\text{ cm}^2$이다. 한편 $\\triangle\\text{ABD} = \\frac{1}{2}\\times\\overline{\\text{AB}}\\times\\overline{\\text{BD}}\\sin x^\\circ$이므로 $$2 = \\frac{1}{2}\\times 2\\sqrt{5}\\times 2\\sqrt{2}\\sin x^\\circ = 2\\sqrt{10}\\sin x^\\circ \\implies \\sin x^\\circ = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10}$$ 따라서 정답은 ①이다.",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes"
    }
  ],
